; ATC_MACRO_ID_HANDRETURN   393 //manual tool return (raise Z, optional go to G30, then return from macro and trap cycle start.  After cycle start Proceed with TCFETCH or HANDFETCH as appropriate)
;
; Called when the outgoing tool needs to be removed by hand (no pocket entry)
; and before the operator pause.
;
; Parameters set by plugin before this macro runs:
;   #4900 = incoming tool number
;   #4902 = outgoing carousel pocket (0 if outgoing tool was not in carousel)

; ── Move to manual change position (G30) ─────────────────────────────────────
; G30 (second home position) is used as the manual tool change position.
G53 G0 Z0
G30

; ── Notify operator ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Add any additional signalling here (lights, buzzers, etc.)
(MSG, Load tool #4900 and press cycle start)
M0
M2
